tems can be salvaged into its components.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Base building</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Ranging from simple shelters to buildings constructed piece by piece. You can also upgrade the buildables and preferably surround them with defences since the enemies can tear them down.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower defence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The enemies will attack your base and might come alone or in hordes. The more you play, the tougher the attacks will be.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cooking</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684760/extras/2e7a37a276d429d1bdc22825bd518a40.poster.avif?t=1741703902\" width=648 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684760/extras/2e7a37a276d429d1bdc22825bd518a40.webm?t=1741703902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684760/extras/2e7a37a276d429d1bdc22825bd518a40.mp4?t=1741703902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- Several basic and advanced meals as well as medicines and different types of enhancing drugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Farming</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684760/extras/22679927b87158e511bffbcad6214cb5.poster.avif?t=1741703902\" width=648 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684760/extras/22679927b87158e511bffbcad6214cb5.webm?t=1741703902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684760/extras/22679927b87158e511bffbcad6214cb5.mp4?t=1741703902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- Plant crops by harvesting seeds from plants, vegetables and fruits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Horses/Mountable horses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684760/extras/31df45bcc74163f3af3649ab3fe3a205.poster.avif?t=1741703902\" width=708 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684760/extras/31df45bcc74163f3af3649ab3fe3a205.webm?t=1741703902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684760/extras/31df45bcc74163f3af3649ab3fe3a205.mp4?t=1741703902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- Riding a horse is a great way of traveling over large distances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Buffs of different kinds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - From food and drinks as well as from making sure you get enough rest and keeping your comfort level high. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skill system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - A rewarding skill system with attributes and perks to enhance your abilities as well as specialize in different areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A rich flora and fauna</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Several different plants, trees, bushes, minerals, animals and fishes ready to be picked up, harvested, cut downed, mined,